true" data-sfc-inited="2"><span class="NMq1me" data-animation-atomic="" jsaction="click:&amp;cimSsf_13|ZUljYd" data-sae="" style=""><span aria-hidden="true">&nbsp;</span><span class=""><span class=""><!--qkimaf cimSsf_13/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb cimSsf_13/HugV6--><button jsuid="cimSsf_14" tabindex="0" data-amic="true" data-icl-uuid="90e171ed-02a8-4c58-ad53-b92f7c2fd8f5" aria-label="Related results" class="vDOt8c" jsaction="click:&amp;cimSsf_13|CXhG2e;mouseenter:&amp;cimSsf_13|wndyDd;mouseleave:&amp;cimSsf_13|yrMC6" data-ved="2ahUKEwiHh4T99sWXAxVIkeEIHb7eDRQQye0OegYIAAgLEAE" data-hveid="CAAICxAB"><span class="pxxQye T6UJT"><div class="a14YJe"><svg class="EQxvpc MZhYme" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" aria-hidden="true" jsaction="" jscontroller="vODoFe#cKfyCe" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="cimSsf_17" data-complete="true"><path d="M440-280H280q-83,0-141.5-58.5T80-480t58.5-141.5T280-680H440v80H280q-50,0-85,35t-35,85t35,85t85,35H440v80ZM320-440v-80H640v80H320ZM520-280v-80H680q50,0 85-35t35-85t-35-85t-85-35H520v-80H680q83,0 141.5,58.5T880-480T821.5-338.5T680-280H520Z"></path><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></svg></div></span><div jsuid="cimSsf_15" style="display: none;" data-ved="2ahUKEwiHh4T99sWXAxVIkeEIHb7eDRQQlZkRegYIAAgLEAI"></div></button></span></span></span><!--qkimaf cimSsf_13/WyzG9e--><!--cqw1tb cimSsf_13/WyzG9e--><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;90e171ed-02a8-4c58-ad53-b92f7c2fd8f5&quot;,null,null,0,&quot;&quot;,&quot;&quot;,0,null,null,null,null,0,null,0]]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><div class="yhAwj" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;cimSsf_18|npT2md" jscontroller="UTzWVc#U8DOt" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="cimSsf_18" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><div jsuid="cimSsf_19" class="BpxUDf aiModeUiCodeBlock__Container" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="Liu6s#lcO7sb" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" data-wiz-uids="cimSsf_1b,cimSsf_1a" data-hveid="CAAIDBAA" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><div data-processed="true"><div class="rq1a2" data-animation-atomic="" data-sae="" style=""><div class="a2TNg"><div class="GlO4G">markdown</div></div><div class="PGvq2d" dir="ltr"><pre><code jsuid="cimSsf_1b"><span class="uiJ0Tc"># Data Cleaning &amp; Visualization Project
</span><span class="undefined">
</span><span class="uiJ0Tc">## Project Overview
</span><span class="undefined">This project focuses on transforming a raw, unrefined dataset into a clean, structured format suitable for analysis. By handling inconsistencies, missing entries, and outlier anomalies, the data was engineered to generate clear visual insights and automated reporting structures using Python.

</span><span class="uiJ0Tc">## Core Deliverables
</span><span class="undefined">* **</span><span class="wy5BN">`cleaned_dataset.csv`</span><span class="undefined">**: The fully processed, structured dataset free of duplicates, missing values, and anomalies.
* **</span><span class="wy5BN">`project.py`</span><span class="undefined"> / </span><span class="wy5BN">`notebook.ipynb`</span><span class="undefined">**: The documented Python execution environment containing cleaning algorithms and plot parameters.
* **</span><span class="wy5BN">`data_insights_dashboard.png`</span><span class="undefined">**: A multi-panel exploratory dashboard mapping critical variables, distributions, and relationship trends.

</span><span class="uiJ0Tc">---
</span><span class="undefined">
</span><span class="uiJ0Tc">## Technical Pipeline &amp; Implementation
</span><span class="undefined">
</span><span class="uiJ0Tc">### 1. Data Cleaning &amp; Preprocessing
</span><span class="uiJ0Tc">* </span><span class="undefined">**Duplicate Mitigation**: Scanned the data matrix for exact record copies and eliminated rows to maintain data integrity.
</span><span class="uiJ0Tc">* </span><span class="undefined">**Missing Value Imputation**: Evaluated missing values per feature column. Imputed numerical gaps using column medians and categorical gaps using the statistical mode.
</span><span class="uiJ0Tc">* </span><span class="undefined">**Outlier Filtration**: Identified statistical distribution tails and filtered out impossible or highly distorted value ranges using conditional logic filters.

</span><span class="uiJ0Tc">### 2. Exploratory Data Visualization
</span><span class="undefined">Using </span><span class="wy5BN">`Matplotlib`</span><span class="undefined"> and </span><span class="wy5BN">`Seaborn`</span><span class="undefined">, a consolidated insights canvas was engineered to track:
</span><span class="uiJ0Tc">* </span><span class="undefined">**Feature Distributions**: Visualized data spreads and skews using univariate kernel density estimator (KDE) maps and histograms.
</span><span class="uiJ0Tc">* </span><span class="undefined">**Relational Key Trends**: Plotted dependency dynamics via scatter/line mappings to isolate variables driving project metrics.

</span><span class="uiJ0Tc">---
</span><span class="undefined">
</span><span class="uiJ0Tc">## Technical Stack &amp; Libraries
</span><span class="uiJ0Tc">* </span><span class="undefined">**Python 3**
</span><span class="uiJ0Tc">* </span><span class="undefined">**Pandas**: Core data structuring, ingestion, and matrix manipulation.
</span><span class="uiJ0Tc">* </span><span class="undefined">**NumPy**: Vectorized data filters and mathematical processing.
</span><span class="uiJ0Tc">* </span><span class="undefined">**Matplotlib**: Canvas layouts, sizing configurations, and axis controls.
</span><span class="uiJ0Tc">* </span><span class="undefined">**Seaborn**: High-level statistical visualization themes and palette layouts.

</span><span class="uiJ0Tc">---
</span><span class="undefined">
</span><span class="uiJ0Tc">## Key Findings &amp; Visual Summary
</span><span class="undefined">* *</span><span class="dk3nFb">[Insert your first key data insight here. Example: Average metrics scaled exponentially alongside resource variables.]</span><span class="undefined">*
* *</span><span class="dk3nFb">[Insert your second key data insight here. Example: Eliminating empty data records resolved a 12% distribution skew in the primary value columns.]</span><span class="undefined">*

The generated dashboard visual summarizing these trends can be found saved as </span><span class="wy5BN">`data_insights_dashboard.png`</span><span class="undefined"> directly within this repository.
</span></code></pre></div></div><div class="iMHp6c" data-animation-atomic="" data-sae="" style=""><div class="ZIumpf">Use code with caution.</div><span jsuid="cimSsf_1a" jsaction="action:&amp;cimSsf_19|ZUljYd" data-ved="2ahUKEwiHh4T99sWXAxVIkeEIHb7eDRQQopQPegYIAAgMEAE"><div jsuid="cimSsf_1c" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="cXTEid#e0nEwf" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" data-ved="2ahUKEwiHh4T99sWXAxVIkeEIHb7eDRQQh9gSegYIAAgMEAI" data-complete="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><button jsuid="cimSsf_1d" class="FTsWP RmjGdc IsqrXb" id="" aria-label="Copy code text to clipboard." data-tooltip-classes="undefined" data-is-tooltip-wrapper="undefined" data-tooltip-id="undefined" aria-describedby="" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="pointerdown:&amp;cimSsf_1d|ZUljYd;pointerup:&amp;cimSsf_1d|aXD3Gb;pointerenter:&amp;cimSsf_1d|Mrjwi;pointerleave:&amp;cimSsf_1d|CXhG2e;pointercancel:&amp;cimSsf_1d|wndyDd;contextmenu:&amp;cimSsf_1d|yrMC6;click:&amp;cimSsf_1d|w9rIQb;focus:&amp;cimSsf_1d|SAMwlb;blur:&amp;cimSsf_1d|hQOfOb;" jscontroller="ETNkje#SiNNTb" data-sfc-root="c" data-complete="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><span class="XjoK4b kkxvEb" jsaction="" jscontroller="bJ5zY#LlrZ1b" data-sfc-root="c" jsuid="cimSsf_1e" data-complete="true"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><span jsuid="cimSsf_1f" class="UTNHae" jsaction="QBlI0e:&amp;cimSsf_1f|JwG8nd;BTifte:&amp;cimSsf_1f|ie0cXb;nqgE9d:&amp;cimSsf_1f|LZznfb;fHTtBd:&amp;cimSsf_1f|i8hBpd;" jscontroller="MAxPne#DBBRWd" data-sfc-root="c" data-complete="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><!--TgQPHd|||[{&quot;u&quot;:0},false]--></span><span class="I36Cje" aria-hidden="true"><!--qkimaf cimSsf_19/HugV6--><svg aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" height="18px" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="18px"><path d="M360-240q-33 0-56.5-23.5T280-320v-480q0-33 23.5-56.5T360-880h360q33 0 56.5 23.5T800-800v480q0 33-23.5 56.5T720-240H360Zm0-80h360v-480H360v480ZM200-80q-33 0-56.5-23.5T120-160v-560h80v560h440v80H200Zm160-240v-480 480Z"></path></svg><!--cqw1tb cimSsf_19/HugV6--></span><div class="ypuoue"></div><!--TgQPHd|||[&quot;Copy code text to clipboard.&quot;,false,{&quot;u&quot;:0},&quot;\u0026cimSsf_1c:UEmoBd&quot;,{&quot;u&quot;:0}]--></button><!--TgQPHd||GVEHxc=*Q0pj3b|[]--></div></span></div></div><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;markdown&quot;,&quot;# Data Cleaning \u0026 Visualization Project\n\n## Project Overview\nThis project focuses on transforming a raw, unrefined dataset into a clean, structured format suitable for analysis. By handling inconsistencies, missing entries, and outlier anomalies, the data was engineered to generate clear visual insights and automated reporting structures using Python.\n\n## Core Deliverables\n* **`cleaned_dataset.csv`**: The fully processed, structured dataset free of duplicates, missing values, and anomalies.\n* **`project.py` / `notebook.ipynb`**: The documented Python execution environment containing cleaning algorithms and plot parameters.\n* **`data_insights_dashboard.png`**: A multi-panel exploratory dashboard mapping critical variables, distributions, and relationship trends.\n\n---\n\n## Technical Pipeline \u0026 Implementation\n\n### 1. Data Cleaning \u0026 Preprocessing\n* **Duplicate Mitigation**: Scanned the data matrix for exact record copies and eliminated rows to maintain data integrity.\n* **Missing Value Imputation**: Evaluated missing values per feature column. Imputed numerical gaps using column medians and categorical gaps using the statistical mode.\n* **Outlier Filtration**: Identified statistical distribution tails and filtered out impossible or highly distorted value ranges using conditional logic filters.\n\n### 2. Exploratory Data Visualization\nUsing `Matplotlib` and `Seaborn`, a consolidated insights canvas was engineered to track:\n* **Feature Distributions**: Visualized data spreads and skews using univariate kernel density estimator (KDE) maps and histograms.\n* **Relational Key Trends**: Plotted dependency dynamics via scatter/line mappings to isolate variables driving project metrics.\n\n---\n\n## Technical Stack \u0026 Libraries\n* **Python 3**\n* **Pandas**: Core data structuring, ingestion, and matrix manipulation.\n* **NumPy**: Vectorized data filters and mathematical processing.\n* **Matplotlib**: Canvas layouts, sizing configurations, and axis controls.\n* **Seaborn**: High-level statistical visualization themes and palette layouts.\n\n---\n\n## Key Findings \u0026 Visual Summary\n* *[Insert your first key data insight here. Example: Average metrics scaled exponentially alongside resource variables.]*\n* *[Insert your second key data insight here. Example: Eliminating empty data records resolved a 12% distribution skew in the primary value columns.]*\n\nThe generated dashboard visual summarizing these trends can be found saved as `data_insights_dashboard.png` directly within this repository.\n&quot;,[[&quot;# Data Cleaning \u0026 Visualization Project\n&quot;,3],[&quot;\n&quot;,0],[&quot;## Project Overview\n&quot;,3],[&quot;This project focuses on transforming a raw, unrefined dataset into a clean, structured format suitable for analysis. By handling inconsistencies, missing entries, and outlier anomalies, the data was engineered to generate clear visual insights and automated reporting structures using Python.\n\n&quot;,0],[&quot;## Core Deliverables\n&quot;,3],[&quot;* **&quot;,0],[&quot;`cleaned_dataset.csv`&quot;,27],[&quot;**: The fully processed, structured dataset free of duplicates, missing values, and anomalies.\n* **&quot;,0],[&quot;`project.py`&quot;,27],[&quot; / &quot;,0],[&quot;`notebook.ipynb`&quot;,27],[&quot;**: The documented Python execution environment containing cleaning algorithms and plot parameters.\n* **&quot;,0],[&quot;`data_insights_dashboard.png`&quot;,27],[&quot;**: A multi-panel exploratory dashboard mapping critical variables, distributions, and relationship trends.\n\n&quot;,0],[&quot;---\n&quot;,3],[&quot;\n&quot;,0],[&quot;## Technical Pipeline \u0026 Implementation\n&quot;,3],[&quot;\n&quot;,0],[&quot;### 1. Data Cleaning \u0026 Preprocessing\n&quot;,3],[&quot;* &quot;,3],[&quot;**Duplicate Mitigation**: Scanned the data matrix for exact record copies and eliminated rows to maintain data integrity.\n&quot;,0],[&quot;* &quot;,3],[&quot;**Missing Value Imputation**: Evaluated missing values per feature column. Imputed numerical gaps using column medians and categorical gaps using the statistical mode.\n&quot;,0],[&quot;* &quot;,3],[&quot;**Outlier Filtration**: Identified statistical distribution tails and filtered out impossible or highly distorted value ranges using conditional logic filters.\n\n&quot;,0],[&quot;### 2. Exploratory Data Visualization\n&quot;,3],[&quot;Using &quot;,0],[&quot;`Matplotlib`&quot;,27],[&quot; and &quot;,0],[&quot;`Seaborn`&quot;,27],[&quot;, a consolidated insights canvas was engineered to track:\n&quot;,0],[&quot;* &quot;,3],[&quot;**Feature Distributions**: Visualized data spreads and skews using univariate kernel density estimator (KDE) maps and histograms.\n&quot;,0],[&quot;* &quot;,3],[&quot;**Relational Key Trends**: Plotted dependency dynamics via scatter/line mappings to isolate variables driving project metrics.\n\n&quot;,0],[&quot;---\n&quot;,3],[&quot;\n&quot;,0],[&quot;## Technical Stack \u0026 Libraries\n&quot;,3],[&quot;* &quot;,3],[&quot;**Python 3**\n&quot;,0],[&quot;* &quot;,3],[&quot;**Pandas**: Core data structuring, ingestion, and matrix manipulation.\n&quot;,0],[&quot;* &quot;,3],[&quot;**NumPy**: Vectorized data filters and mathematical processing.\n&quot;,0],[&quot;* &quot;,3],[&quot;**Matplotlib**: Canvas layouts, sizing configurations, and axis controls.\n&quot;,0],[&quot;* &quot;,3],[&quot;**Seaborn**: High-level statistical visualization themes and palette layouts.\n\n&quot;,0],[&quot;---\n&quot;,3],[&quot;\n&quot;,0],[&quot;## Key Findings \u0026 Visual Summary\n&quot;,3],[&quot;* *&quot;,0],[&quot;[Insert your first key data insight here. Example: Average metrics scaled exponentially alongside resource variables.]&quot;,4],[&quot;*\n* *&quot;,0],[&quot;[Insert your second key data insight here. Example: Eliminating empty data records resolved a 12% distribution skew in the primary value columns.]&quot;,4],[&quot;*\n\nThe generated dashboard visual summarizing these trends can be found saved as &quot;,0],[&quot;`data_insights_dashboard.png`&quot;,27],[&quot; directly within this repository.\n&quot;,0]]]]--></div><div class="yhAwj" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;cimSsf_1g|npT2md" jscontroller="UTzWVc#U8DOt" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="cimSsf_1g" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><hr class="s6NV4e" jsaction="" jscontroller="gWGJ0d#iOlsLd" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="cimSsf_1h" data-sfc-pl="|||[]" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sae="" style=""><div class="yhAwj" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;cimSsf_1i|npT2md" jscontroller="UTzWVc#U8DOt" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="cimSsf_1i" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><div class="ZLzG0d ncoeY E8xBUb" role="heading" aria-level="3" data-animation-nesting="" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" data-wiz-attrbind="aria-level=cimSsf_1j/fLk2Md" jscontroller="zg1ZQe#TswZNc" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="cimSsf_1j" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sae="" style="">💡 Tips for Customization<!--TgQPHd|||[[2,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[351768,null,0]],[],null,1]]--></div><ul class="XSq4R KI3fJ" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="wiLEJc#NS0kde" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="cimSsf_1k" data-hveid="CAAIDxAA" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"><li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="cimSsf_1l" data-hveid="CAAIDxAB" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style=""><span class="iNqyIf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="KdQfFc#d5Qebf" data-sfc