</span></code></pre></div></div><div class="iMHp6c" data-animation-atomic="" data-sae="" style=""><div class="ZIumpf">Use code with caution.</div><span jsuid="krO72_1v" jsaction="action:&amp;krO72_1u|ZUljYd" data-ved="2ahUKEwjLge3z-MWXAxVhj-EIHZ8oA1kQopQPegYIAAgXEAE"><div jsuid="krO72_1x" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="cXTEid#e0nEwf" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" data-ved="2ahUKEwjLge3z-MWXAxVhj-EIHZ8oA1kQh9gSegYIAAgXEAI" data-complete="true"><button jsuid="krO72_1y" class="FTsWP RmjGdc IsqrXb" id="" aria-label="Copy code text to clipboard." data-tooltip-classes="undefined" data-is-tooltip-wrapper="undefined" data-tooltip-id="undefined" aria-describedby="" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="pointerdown:&amp;krO72_1y|ZUljYd;pointerup:&amp;krO72_1y|aXD3Gb;pointerenter:&amp;krO72_1y|Mrjwi;pointerleave:&amp;krO72_1y|CXhG2e;pointercancel:&amp;krO72_1y|wndyDd;contextmenu:&amp;krO72_1y|yrMC6;click:&amp;krO72_1y|w9rIQb;focus:&amp;krO72_1y|SAMwlb;blur:&amp;krO72_1y|hQOfOb;" data-wiz-attrbind="disabled=krO72_1y/ggNWmb;aria-label=krO72_1y/mCevaf" jscontroller="ETNkje#SiNNTb" data-sfc-root="c" data-complete="true"><span class="XjoK4b kkxvEb" jsaction="" jscontroller="bJ5zY#LlrZ1b" data-sfc-root="c" jsuid="krO72_1z" data-complete="true"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><span jsuid="krO72_20" class="UTNHae" jsaction="QBlI0e:&amp;krO72_20|JwG8nd;BTifte:&amp;krO72_20|ie0cXb;nqgE9d:&amp;krO72_20|LZznfb;fHTtBd:&amp;krO72_20|i8hBpd;" data-wiz-attrbind="class=krO72_20/ggNWmb" jscontroller="MAxPne#DBBRWd" data-sfc-root="c" data-complete="true"><!--TgQPHd|||[{&quot;u&quot;:0},false]--></span><span class="I36Cje" aria-hidden="true"><!--qkimaf krO72_1u/HugV6--><svg aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" height="18px" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="18px"><path d="M360-240q-33 0-56.5-23.5T280-320v-480q0-33 23.5-56.5T360-880h360q33 0 56.5 23.5T800-800v480q0 33-23.5 56.5T720-240H360Zm0-80h360v-480H360v480ZM200-80q-33 0-56.5-23.5T120-160v-560h80v560h440v80H200Zm160-240v-480 480Z"></path></svg><!--cqw1tb krO72_1u/HugV6--></span><div class="ypuoue"></div><!--TgQPHd|||[&quot;Copy code text to clipboard.&quot;,false,{&quot;u&quot;:0},&quot;\u0026krO72_1x:UEmoBd&quot;,{&quot;u&quot;:0}]--></button><!--TgQPHd||GVEHxc=*Q0pj3b|[]--></div></span></div></div><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;text&quot;,&quot;Student_ID,Age,Study_Hours,Exam_Score\nSTU_1001,20.0,8.0,75.0\nSTU_1002,21.0,12.0,84.0\nSTU_1003,19.0,5.0,68.0\nSTU_1004,20.0,15.0,92.0\nSTU_1006,22.0,8.0,75.0\nSTU_1008,23.0,12.0,84.0\nSTU_1010,24.0,20.0,92.0\n&quot;,[[&quot;Student_ID,Age,Study_Hours,Exam_Score\nSTU_1001,20.0,8.0,75.0\nSTU_1002,21.0,12.0,84.0\nSTU_1003,19.0,5.0,68.0\nSTU_1004,20.0,15.0,92.0\nSTU_1006,22.0,8.0,75.0\nSTU_1008,23.0,12.0,84.0\nSTU_1010,24.0,20.0,92.0\n&quot;,0]]]]--></div><div class="yhAwj" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;krO72_21|npT2md" jscontroller="UTzWVc#U8DOt" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_21" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><hr class="s6NV4e" jsaction="" jscontroller="gWGJ0d#iOlsLd" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_22" data-sfc-pl="|||[]" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sae="" style=""><div class="yhAwj" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;krO72_23|npT2md" jscontroller="UTzWVc#U8DOt" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_23" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><div class="ZLzG0d ncoeY E8xBUb" role="heading" aria-level="3" data-animation-nesting="" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" data-wiz-attrbind="aria-level=krO72_24/fLk2Md" jscontroller="zg1ZQe#TswZNc" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_24" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sae="" style="">Step 2: Create Your Python Script File<!--TgQPHd|||[[2,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[351768,null,0]],[],null,1]]--></div><div class="n6owBd awi2gc" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="TDBkbc#Ml18Xb" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_25" data-hveid="CAAIGhAA" data-complete="true" data-processed="true">Now you need to save the Python code script that cleans the raw data and builds the visualization plots.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><ol class="T9WCjf qkgVBf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="PnN4Le#N1SbDe" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_26" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"><li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_27" data-hveid="CAAIGxAB" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style=""><span class="iNqyIf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="KdQfFc#d5Qebf" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_28" data-complete="true">Open another new blank document in <strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_29" data-complete="true">Notepad<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_2a" data-hveid="CAAIGxAC" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style=""><span class="iNqyIf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="KdQfFc#d5Qebf" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_2b" data-complete="true"><strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_2c" data-complete="true">Copy and paste<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> this exact code block into the file:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></ol><div style="display:none;" jsuid="krO72_2d" data-complete="true" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;krO72_2d|npT2md" jscontroller="LmU7De#TzOkP" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><!--TgQPHd|||[[null,null,null,&quot;&quot;,0,0,null,0,&quot;&quot;,[&quot;&quot;,&quot;&quot;],null,[],null,[[[[&quot;Thinking a little longer&quot;]],null,261344]]]]--></div><div class="yhAwj" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;krO72_2e|npT2md" jscontroller="UTzWVc#U8DOt" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_2e" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><div jsuid="krO72_2f" class="BpxUDf aiModeUiCodeBlock__Container" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="Liu6s#lcO7sb" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" data-wiz-uids="krO72_2h,krO72_2g" data-hveid="CAAIHRAA" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"><div data-processed="true"><div class="rq1a2" data-animation-atomic="" data-sae="" style=""><div class="a2TNg"><div class="GlO4G">python</div></div><div class="PGvq2d" dir="ltr"><pre><code jsuid="krO72_2h"><span class="uiJ0Tc">import</span><span class="undefined"> </span><span class="yqj1Pc">pandas</span><span class="undefined"> </span><span class="uiJ0Tc">as</span><span class="undefined"> pd
</span><span class="uiJ0Tc">import</span><span class="undefined"> </span><span class="yqj1Pc">numpy</span><span class="undefined"> </span><span class="uiJ0Tc">as</span><span class="undefined"> np
</span><span class="uiJ0Tc">import</span><span class="undefined"> </span><span class="yqj1Pc">matplotlib</span><span class="undefined">.</span><span class="yqj1Pc">pyplot</span><span class="undefined"> </span><span class="uiJ0Tc">as</span><span class="undefined"> plt
</span><span class="uiJ0Tc">import</span><span class="undefined"> </span><span class="yqj1Pc">seaborn</span><span class="undefined"> </span><span class="uiJ0Tc">as</span><span class="undefined"> sns

</span><span class="ojrtQ"># 1. Load raw dataset</span><span class="undefined">
</span><span class="yqj1Pc">df</span><span class="undefined"> = pd.read_csv(</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">raw_dataset.csv</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">)
print(</span><span class="dk3nFb">"</span><span class="dk3nFb">Initial raw dataset shape:</span><span class="dk3nFb">"</span><span class="undefined">, df.shape)

</span><span class="ojrtQ"># 2. Drop duplicates</span><span class="undefined">
</span><span class="yqj1Pc">df</span><span class="undefined"> = df.drop_duplicates()

</span><span class="ojrtQ"># 3. Handle outliers (Removes impossible ages and score numbers)</span><span class="undefined">
</span><span class="yqj1Pc">df</span><span class="undefined"> = df[(df[</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">Age</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">] &gt; </span><span class="N1kUHb">0</span><span class="undefined">) &amp; (df[</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">Age</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">] &lt; </span><span class="N1kUHb">100</span><span class="undefined">)]
</span><span class="yqj1Pc">df</span><span class="undefined"> = df[(df[</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">Exam_Score</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">] &gt;= </span><span class="N1kUHb">0</span><span class="undefined">) &amp; (df[</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">Exam_Score</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">] &lt;= </span><span class="N1kUHb">100</span><span class="undefined">)]

</span><span class="ojrtQ"># 4. Handle missing values using column median values</span><span class="undefined">
df[</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">Age</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">] = df[</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">Age</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">].fillna(df[</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">Age</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">].median())
df[</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">Study_Hours</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">] = df[</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">Study_Hours</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">].fillna(df[</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">Study_Hours</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">].median())
df[</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">Exam_Score</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">] = df[</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">Exam_Score</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">].fillna(df[</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">Exam_Score</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">].median())

</span><span class="ojrtQ"># 5. Export finalized clean dataset </span><span class="undefined">
df.to_csv(</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">cleaned_dataset.csv</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">, index=</span><span class="uiJ0Tc">False</span><span class="undefined">)
print(</span><span class="dk3nFb">"</span><span class="dk3nFb">Cleaned dataset successfully created!</span><span class="dk3nFb">"</span><span class="undefined">)

</span><span class="ojrtQ"># 6. Generate exploratory visualization report dashboard</span><span class="undefined">
sns.set_theme(style=</span><span class="dk3nFb">"</span><span class="dk3nFb">darkgrid</span><span class="dk3nFb">"</span><span class="undefined">)
</span><span class="yqj1Pc">fig</span><span class="undefined">, </span><span class="yqj1Pc">axes</span><span class="undefined"> = plt.subplots(</span><span class="N1kUHb">1</span><span class="undefined">, </span><span class="N1kUHb">2</span><span class="undefined">, figsize=(</span><span class="N1kUHb">12</span><span class="undefined">, </span><span class="N1kUHb">5</span><span class="undefined">))

</span><span class="ojrtQ"># Plot A: Age spread mapping</span><span class="undefined">
sns.histplot(df[</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">Age</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">], bins=</span><span class="N1kUHb">6</span><span class="undefined">, kde=</span><span class="uiJ0Tc">True</span><span class="undefined">, ax=axes[</span><span class="N1kUHb">0</span><span class="undefined">], color=</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">dodgerblue</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">)
axes[</span><span class="N1kUHb">0</span><span class="undefined">].set_title(</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">Student Age Profile Distribution</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">)

</span><span class="ojrtQ"># Plot B: Study hours vs Exam scores</span><span class="undefined">
sns.scatterplot(data=df, x=</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">Study_Hours</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">, y=</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">Exam_Score</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">, ax=axes[</span><span class="N1kUHb">1</span><span class="undefined">], color=</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">crimson</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">)
axes[</span><span class="N1kUHb">1</span><span class="undefined">].set_title(</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">Study Hours vs. Academic Metric Correlation</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">)

plt.tight_layout()
plt.savefig(</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">data_insights_dashboard.png</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">, dpi=</span><span class="N1kUHb">150</span><span class="undefined">)
print(</span><span class="dk3nFb">"</span><span class="dk3nFb">Dashboard report image saved locally as data_insights_dashboard.png.</span><span class="dk3nFb">"</span><span class="undefined">)
</span></code></pre></div></div><div class="iMHp6c" data-animation-atomic="" data-sae="" style=""><div class="ZIumpf">Use code with caution.</div><span jsuid="krO72_2g" jsaction="action:&amp;krO72_2f|ZUljYd" data-ved="2ahUKEwjLge3z-MWXAxVhj-EIHZ8oA1kQopQPegYIAAgdEAE"><div jsuid="krO72_2i" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="cXTEid#e0nEwf" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" data-ved="2ahUKEwjLge3z-MWXAxVhj-EIHZ8oA1kQh9gSegYIAAgdEAI" data-complete="true"><button jsuid="krO72_2j" class="FTsWP RmjGdc IsqrXb" id="" aria-label="Copy code text to clipboard." data-tooltip-classes="undefined" data-is-tooltip-wrapper="undefined" data-tooltip-id="undefined" aria-describedby="" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="pointerdown:&amp;krO72_2j|ZUljYd;pointerup:&amp;krO72_2j|aXD3Gb;pointerenter:&amp;krO72_2j|Mrjwi;pointerleave:&amp;krO72_2j|CXhG2e;pointercancel:&amp;krO72_2j|wndyDd;contextmenu:&amp;krO72_2j|yrMC6;click:&amp;krO72_2j|w9rIQb;focus:&amp;krO72_2j|SAMwlb;blur:&amp;krO72_2j|hQOfOb;" data-wiz-attrbind="disabled=krO72_2j/ggNWmb;aria-label=krO72_2j/mCevaf" jscontroller="ETNkje#SiNNTb" data-sfc-root="c" data-complete="true"><span class="XjoK4b kkxvEb" jsaction="" jscontroller="bJ5zY#LlrZ1b" data-sfc-root="c" jsuid="krO72_2k" data-complete="true"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><span jsuid="krO72_2l" class="UTNHae" jsaction="QBlI0e:&amp;krO72_2l|JwG8nd;BTifte:&amp;krO72_2l|ie0cXb;nqgE9d:&amp;krO72_2l|LZznfb;fHTtBd:&amp;krO72_2l|i8hBpd;" data-wiz-attrbind="class=krO72_2l/ggNWmb" jscontroller="MAxPne#DBBRWd" data-sfc-root="c" data-complete="true"><!--TgQPHd|||[{&quot;u&quot;:0},false]--></span><span class="I36Cje" aria-hidden="true"><!--qkimaf krO72_2f/HugV6--><svg aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" height="18px" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="18px"><path d="M360-240q-33 0-56.5-23.5T280-320v-480q0-33 23.5-56.5T360-880h360q33 0 56.5 23.5T800-800v480q0 33-23.5 56.5T720-240H360Zm0-80h360v-480H360v480ZM200-80q-33 0-56.5-23.5T120-160v-560h80v560h440v80H200Zm160-240v-480 480Z"></path></svg><!--cqw1tb krO72_2f/HugV6--></span><div class="ypuoue"></div><!--TgQPHd|||[&quot;Copy code text to clipboard.&quot;,false,{&quot;u&quot;:0},&quot;\u0026krO72_2i:UEmoBd&quot;,{&quot;u&quot;:0}]--></button><!--TgQPHd||GVEHxc=*Q0pj3b|[]--></div></span></div></div><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;python&quot;,&quot;import pandas as pd\nimport numpy as np\nimport matplotlib.pyplot as plt\nimport seaborn as sns\n\n# 1. Load raw dataset\ndf \u003d pd.read_csv(&#39;raw_dataset.csv&#39;)\nprint(\&quot;Initial raw dataset shape:\&quot;, df.shape)\n\n# 2. Drop duplicates\ndf \u003d df.drop_duplicates()\n\n# 3. Handle outliers (Removes impossible ages and score numbers)\ndf \u003d df[(df[&#39;Age&#39;] \u003e 0) \u0026 (df[&#39;Age&#39;] \u003c 100)]\ndf \u003d df[(df[&#39;Exam_Score&#39;] \u003e\u003d 0) \u0026 (df[&#39;Exam_Score&#39;] \u003c\u003d 100)]\n\n# 4. Handle missing values using column median values\ndf[&#39;Age&#39;] \u003d df[&#39;Age&#39;].fillna(df[&#39;Age&#39;].median())\ndf[&#39;Study_Hours&#39;] \u003d df[&#39;Study_Hours&#39;].fillna(df[&#39;Study_Hours&#39;].median())\ndf[&#39;Exam_Score&#39;] \u003d df[&#39;Exam_Score&#39;].fillna(df[&#39;Exam_Score&#39;].median())\n\n# 5. Export finalized clean dataset \ndf.to_csv(&#39;cleaned_dataset.csv&#39;, index\u003dFalse)\nprint(\&quot;Cleaned dataset successfully created!\&quot;)\n\n# 6. Generate exploratory visualization report dashboard\nsns.set_theme(style\u003d\&quot;darkgrid\&quot;)\nfig, axes \u003d plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize\u003d(12, 5))\n\n# Plot A: Age spread mapping\nsns.histplot(df[&#39;Age&#39;], bins\u003d6, kde\u003dTrue, ax\u003daxes[0], color\u003d&#39;dodgerblue&#39;)\naxes[0].set_title(&#39;Student Age Profile Distribution&#39;)\n\n# Plot B: Study hours vs Exam scores\nsns.scatterplot(data\u003ddf, x\u003d&#39;Study_Hours&#39;, y\u003d&#39;Exam_Score&#39;, ax\u003daxes[1], color\u003d&#39;crimson&#39;)\naxes[1].set_title(&#39;Study Hours vs. Academic Metric Correlation&#39;)\n\nplt.tight_layout()\nplt.savefig(&