ta-epip="" jsuid="krO72_2p" data-complete="true">All Files (*.*)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>, and name it <strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_2q" data-complete="true"><code dir="ltr" class="KDcb0c" jsaction="" jscontroller="hNviFe#redMub" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_2r" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style="">project.py<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></code><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></ol><div class="yhAwj" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;krO72_2s|npT2md" jscontroller="UTzWVc#U8DOt" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_2s" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><hr class="s6NV4e" jsaction="" jscontroller="gWGJ0d#iOlsLd" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_2t" data-sfc-pl="|||[]" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sae="" style=""><div class="yhAwj" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;krO72_2u|npT2md" jscontroller="UTzWVc#U8DOt" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_2u" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><div class="ZLzG0d ncoeY E8xBUb" role="heading" aria-level="3" data-animation-nesting="" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" data-wiz-attrbind="aria-level=krO72_2v/fLk2Md" jscontroller="zg1ZQe#TswZNc" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_2v" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sae="" style="">Step 3: Get Your Visualization Image<!--TgQPHd|||[[2,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[351768,null,0]],[],null,1]]--></div><div class="n6owBd awi2gc" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="TDBkbc#Ml18Xb" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_2w" data-hveid="CAAIIRAA" data-complete="true" data-processed="true">If you run <code dir="ltr" class="KDcb0c" jsaction="" jscontroller="hNviFe#redMub" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_2x" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style="">project.py<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></code> on your computer using Python, it automatically outputs your dashboard image. If your environment isn't set up yet, you can use any chart creation tool (like Excel) or download a sample multi-pane plot from your dashboard tools to name as <strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_2y" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"><code dir="ltr" class="KDcb0c" jsaction="" jscontroller="hNviFe#redMub" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_2z" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style="">data_insights_dashboard.png<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></code><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><div class="yhAwj" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;krO72_30|npT2md" jscontroller="UTzWVc#U8DOt" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_30" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><hr class="s6NV4e" jsaction="" jscontroller="gWGJ0d#iOlsLd" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_31" data-sfc-pl="|||[]" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sae="" style=""><div class="yhAwj" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;krO72_32|npT2md" jscontroller="UTzWVc#U8DOt" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_32" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><div class="ZLzG0d ncoeY E8xBUb" role="heading" aria-level="3" data-animation-nesting="" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" data-wiz-attrbind="aria-level=krO72_33/fLk2Md" jscontroller="zg1ZQe#TswZNc" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_33" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sae="" style="">Step 4: Upload everything to GitHub<!--TgQPHd|||[[2,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[351768,null,0]],[],null,1]]--></div><div class="n6owBd awi2gc" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="TDBkbc#Ml18Xb" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_34" data-hveid="CAAIJBAA" data-complete="true" data-processed="true">Now that you have your three files ready on your computer, head back to your GitHub screen shown in your last message:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><ol class="T9WCjf qkgVBf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="PnN4Le#N1SbDe" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_35" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"><li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_36" data-hveid="CAAIJRAB" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style=""><span class="iNqyIf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="KdQfFc#d5Qebf" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_37" data-complete="true">Click on the <strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_38" data-complete="true">Add file<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> dropdown button and choose <strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_39" data-complete="true">Upload files<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_3a" data-hveid="CAAIJRAC" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style=""><span class="iNqyIf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="KdQfFc#d5Qebf" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_3b" data-complete="true">Select your new <strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_3c" data-complete="true"><code dir="ltr" class="KDcb0c" jsaction="" jscontroller="hNviFe#redMub" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_3d" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style="">project.py<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></code><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>, <strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_3e" data-complete="true"><code dir="ltr" class="KDcb0c" jsaction="" jscontroller="hNviFe#redMub" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_3f" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style="">cleaned_dataset.csv<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></code><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>, and <strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_3g" data-complete="true"><code dir="ltr" class="KDcb0c" jsaction="" jscontroller="hNviFe#redMub" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_3h" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style="">data_insights_dashboard.png<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></code><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> files and drag them into the upload field.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_3i" data-hveid="CAAIJRAD" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style=""><span class="iNqyIf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="KdQfFc#d5Qebf" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_3j" data-complete="true">Scroll down, type <code dir="ltr" class="KDcb0c" jsaction="" jscontroller="hNviFe#redMub" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_3k" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style="">Initial project file upload<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></code> in the commit box, and click <strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_3l" data-complete="true">Commit changes<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_3m" data-hveid="CAAIJRAE" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style=""><span class="iNqyIf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="KdQfFc#d5Qebf" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_3n" data-complete="true">Copy the URL from your top address bar and submit it inside your student intern portal to finish your work!<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></ol><div class="yhAwj" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;krO72_3o|npT2md" jscontroller="UTzWVc#U8DOt" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_3o" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><div class="AHmQrc" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="LkYPVc#wdvZmf" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_3p" data-hveid="CAAIJhAA" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"><div class="n6owBd awi2gc" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="TDBkbc#Ml18Xb" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_3q" data-hveid="CAAIJhAB" data-complete="true" data-processed="true">Let me know if you run into any formatting or saving issues while creating these <strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_3r" data-complete="true" data-processed="true">three files<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> on your computer!<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><div class="yhAwj" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;krO72_3s|npT2md" jscontroller="UTzWVc#U8DOt" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_3s" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><div style="display: none;" jsuid="krO72_3t" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;krO72_3t|npT2md" jscontroller="KEp6jb#HjxGxd" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><!--TgQPHd|||[[null,null,1,[&quot;cd0Gwf&quot;,&quot;[\&quot;j_rVavD8Db6khvcP8ZLoqQk\&quot;]&quot;]]]--></div><div class="yhAwj" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;krO72_3u|npT2md" jscontroller="UTzWVc#U8DOt" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="krO72_3u" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><div jsuid="krO72_41" data-xid="Gd7Hsc" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="rc