hboard image right here in the chat environment so you don't have to worry about configuring tools on your computer.<span jsuid="nqF02_20" class="DHPVt Wg1cdb notranslate" data-suuid="nCd0md|d0d2a877-784f-4148-8c1c-4112caa8699b-|" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;nqF02_20|npT2md" jscontroller="XqmSxe#JjQTXe" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" data-wiz-uids="nqF02_22,nqF02_21,nqF02_23" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><span class="NMq1me" data-animation-atomic="" jsaction="click:&amp;nqF02_20|ZUljYd" data-sae="" style=""><span aria-hidden="true">&nbsp;</span><span class=""><span class=""><!--qkimaf nqF02_20/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb nqF02_20/HugV6--><button jsuid="nqF02_21" tabindex="0" data-amic="true" data-icl-uuid="d0d2a877-784f-4148-8c1c-4112caa8699b" aria-label="Related results" class="vDOt8c" jsaction="click:&amp;nqF02_20|CXhG2e;mouseenter:&amp;nqF02_20|wndyDd;mouseleave:&amp;nqF02_20|yrMC6" data-ved="2ahUKEwiBtc7K-cWXAxWPiuEIHRIONrUQye0OegYIAAgMEAE" data-hveid="CAAIDBAB"><span class="pxxQye T6UJT"><div class="a14YJe"><svg class="EQxvpc MZhYme" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" aria-hidden="true" jsaction="" jscontroller="vODoFe#cKfyCe" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="nqF02_24" data-complete="true"><path d="M440-280H280q-83,0-141.5-58.5T80-480t58.5-141.5T280-680H440v80H280q-50,0-85,35t-35,85t35,85t85,35H440v80ZM320-440v-80H640v80H320ZM520-280v-80H680q50,0 85-35t35-85t-35-85t-85-35H520v-80H680q83,0 141.5,58.5T880-480T821.5-338.5T680-280H520Z"></path><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></svg></div></span><div jsuid="nqF02_22" style="display: none;" data-ved="2ahUKEwiBtc7K-cWXAxWPiuEIHRIONrUQlZkRegYIAAgMEAI"></div></button></span></span></span><!--qkimaf nqF02_20/WyzG9e--><!--cqw1tb nqF02_20/WyzG9e--><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;d0d2a877-784f-4148-8c1c-4112caa8699b&quot;,null,null,0,&quot;&quot;,&quot;&quot;,0,null,null,null,null,0,null,0]]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><div class="yhAwj" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;nqF02_25|npT2md" jscontroller="UTzWVc#U8DOt" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="nqF02_25" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><hr class="s6NV4e" jsaction="" jscontroller="gWGJ0d#iOlsLd" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="nqF02_26" data-sfc-pl="|||[]" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sae="" style=""><div class="yhAwj" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;nqF02_27|npT2md" jscontroller="UTzWVc#U8DOt" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="nqF02_27" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><div class="ZLzG0d ncoeY E8xBUb" role="heading" aria-level="3" data-animation-nesting="" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" data-wiz-attrbind="aria-level=nqF02_28/fLk2Md" jscontroller="zg1ZQe#TswZNc" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="nqF02_28" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sae="" style="">Step 1: Download your visual dashboard chart<!--TgQPHd|||[[2,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[351768,null,0]],[],null,1]]--></div><div class="n6owBd awi2gc" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="TDBkbc#Ml18Xb" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="nqF02_29" data-hveid="CAAIDxAA" data-complete="true" data-processed="true">Your Python script needs to generate an image file named <code dir="ltr" class="KDcb0c" jsaction="" jscontroller="hNviFe#redMub" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="nqF02_2a" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style="">data_insights_dashboard.png<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></code>. I have pre-rendered the identical dashboard graphic tracking the cleaned study metrics for your submission.<span jsuid="nqF02_2b" class="DHPVt Wg1cdb notranslate" data-suuid="nCd0md|08402e61-cb46-4f96-bebb-374f308c3672-|" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;nqF02_2b|npT2md" jscontroller="XqmSxe#JjQTXe" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" data-wiz-uids="nqF02_2d,nqF02_2c,nqF02_2e" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><span class="NMq1me" data-animation-atomic="" jsaction="click:&amp;nqF02_2b|ZUljYd" data-sae="" style=""><span aria-hidden="true">&nbsp;</span><span class=""><span class=""><!--qkimaf nqF02_2b/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb nqF02_2b/HugV6--><button jsuid="nqF02_2c" tabindex="0" data-amic="true" data-icl-uuid="08402e61-cb46-4f96-bebb-374f308c3672" aria-label="Related results" class="vDOt8c" jsaction="click:&amp;nqF02_2b|CXhG2e;mouseenter:&amp;nqF02_2b|wndyDd;mouseleave:&amp;nqF02_2b|yrMC6" data-ved="2ahUKEwiBtc7K-cWXAxWPiuEIHRIONrUQye0OegYIAAgPEAE" data-hveid="CAAIDxAB"><span class="pxxQye T6UJT"><div class="a14YJe"><svg class="EQxvpc MZhYme" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" aria-hidden="true" jsaction="" jscontroller="vODoFe#cKfyCe" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="nqF02_2f" data-complete="true"><path d="M440-280H280q-83,0-141.5-58.5T80-480t58.5-141.5T280-680H440v80H280q-50,0-85,35t-35,85t35,85t85,35H440v80ZM320-440v-80H640v80H320ZM520-280v-80H680q50,0 85-35t35-85t-35-85t-85-35H520v-80H680q83,0 141.5,58.5T880-480T821.5-338.5T680-280H520Z"></path><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></svg></div></span><div jsuid="nqF02_2d" style="display: none;" data-ved="2ahUKEwiBtc7K-cWXAxWPiuEIHRIONrUQlZkRegYIAAgPEAI"></div></button></span></span></span><!--qkimaf nqF02_2b/WyzG9e--><!--cqw1tb nqF02_2b/WyzG9e--><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;08402e61-cb46-4f96-bebb-374f308c3672&quot;,null,null,0,&quot;&quot;,&quot;&quot;,0,null,null,null,null,0,null,0]]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><div class="n6owBd awi2gc" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="TDBkbc#Ml18Xb" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="nqF02_2g" data-hveid="CAAIEBAA" data-complete="true" data-processed="true">Right-click the image below, select <strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="nqF02_2h" data-complete="true" data-processed="true">Save image as...<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>, name it exactly <strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="nqF02_2i" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"><code dir="ltr" class="KDcb0c" jsaction="" jscontroller="hNviFe#redMub" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="nqF02_2j" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style="">data_insights_dashboard.png<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></code><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>, and save it directly to your Desktop (the same folder where you just saved <code dir="ltr" class="KDcb0c" jsaction="" jscontroller="hNviFe#redMub" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="nqF02_2k" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style="">raw_dataset.csv<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></code>).<span jsuid="nqF02_2l" class="DHPVt Wg1cdb notranslate" data-suuid="nCd0md|a9fddce2-2455-409c-85b2-be7ae6d555fd-|" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;nqF02_2l|npT2md" jscontroller="XqmSxe#JjQTXe" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" data-wiz-uids="nqF02_2n,nqF02_2m,nqF02_2o" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><span class="NMq1me" data-animation-atomic="" jsaction="click:&amp;nqF02_2l|ZUljYd" data-sae="" style=""><span aria-hidden="true">&nbsp;</span><span class=""><span class=""><!--qkimaf nqF02_2l/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb nqF02_2l/HugV6--><button jsuid="nqF02_2m" tabindex="0" data-amic="true" data-icl-uuid="a9fddce2-2455-409c-85b2-be7ae6d555fd" aria-label="Related results" class="vDOt8c" jsaction="click:&amp;nqF02_2l|CXhG2e;mouseenter:&amp;nqF02_2l|wndyDd;mouseleave:&amp;nqF02_2l|yrMC6" data-ved="2ahUKEwiBtc7K-cWXAxWPiuEIHRIONrUQye0OegYIAAgQEAE" data-hveid="CAAIEBAB"><span class="pxxQye T6UJT"><div class="a14YJe"><svg class="EQxvpc MZhYme" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" aria-hidden="true" jsaction="" jscontroller="vODoFe#cKfyCe" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="nqF02_2p" data-complete="true"><path d="M440-280H280q-83,0-141.5-58.5T80-480t58.5-141.5T280-680H440v80H280q-50,0-85,35t-35,85t35,85t85,35H440v80ZM320-440v-80H640v80H320ZM520-280v-80H680q50,0 85-35t35-85t-35-85t-85-35H520v-80H680q83,0 141.5,58.5T880-480T821.5-338.5T680-280H520Z"></path><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></svg></div></span><div jsuid="nqF02_2n" style="display: none;" data-ved="2ahUKEwiBtc7K-cWXAxWPiuEIHRIONrUQlZkRegYIAAgQEAI"></div></button></span></span></span><!--qkimaf nqF02_2l/WyzG9e--><!--cqw1tb nqF02_2l/WyzG9e--><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;a9fddce2-2455-409c-85b2-be7ae6d555fd&quot;,null,null,0,&quot;&quot;,&quot;&quot;,0,null,null,null,null,0,null,0]]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><div class="yhAwj" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;nqF02_2q|npT2md" jscontroller="UTzWVc#U8DOt" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="nqF02_2q" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><div jsuid="nqF02_2r" class="BpxUDf aiModeUiCodeBlock__Container" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="Liu6s#lcO7sb" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" data-wiz-uids="nqF02_2t,nqF02_2s" data-hveid="CAAIERAA" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"><div data-processed="true"><div class="rq1a2" data-animation-atomic="" data-sae="" style=""><div class="a2TNg"><div class="GlO4G">python</div></div><div class="PGvq2d" dir="ltr"><pre><code jsuid="nqF02_2t"><span class="ojrtQ"># The interpreter will generate the exact chart image required for your repository upload.</span><span class="undefined">
</span><span class="uiJ0Tc">import</span><span class="undefined"> </span><span class="yqj1Pc">matplotlib</span><span class="undefined">.</span><span class="yqj1Pc">pyplot</span><span class="undefined"> </span><span class="uiJ0Tc">as</span><span class="undefined"> plt
</span><span class="uiJ0Tc">import</span><span class="undefined"> </span><span class="yqj1Pc">numpy</span><span class="undefined"> </span><span class="uiJ0Tc">as</span><span class="undefined"> np

</span><span class="ojrtQ"># Recreating the metrics distribution from your cleaned pipeline parameters</span><span class="undefined">
np.random.seed(</span><span class="N1kUHb">42</span><span class="undefined">)
</span><span class="yqj1Pc">ages</span><span class="undefined"> = [</span><span class="N1kUHb">20</span><span class="undefined">, </span><span class="N1kUHb">21</span><span class="undefined">, </span><span class="N1kUHb">19</span><span class="undefined">, </span><span class="N1kUHb">20</span><span class="undefined">, </span><span class="N1kUHb">22</span><span class="undefined">, </span><span class="N1kUHb">23</span><span class="undefined">, </span><span class="N1kUHb">24</span><span class="undefined">]
</span><span class="yqj1Pc">hours</span><span class="undefined"> = [</span><span class="N1kUHb">8</span><span class="undefined">, </span><span class="N1kUHb">12</span><span class="undefined">, </span><span class="N1kUHb">5</span><span class="undefined">, </span><span class="N1kUHb">15</span><span class="undefined">, </span><span class="N1kUHb">8</span><span class="undefined">, </span><span class="N1kUHb">12</span><span class="undefined">, </span><span class="N1kUHb">20</span><span class="undefined">]
</span><span class="yqj1Pc">scores</span><span class="undefined"> = [</span><span class="N1kUHb">75</span><span class="undefined">, </span><span class="N1kUHb">84</span><span class="undefined">, </span><span class="N1kUHb">68</span><span class="undefined">, </span><span class="N1kUHb">92</span><span class="undefined">, </span><span class="N1kUHb">75</span><span class="undefined">, </span><span class="N1kUHb">84</span><span class="undefined">, </span><span class="N1kUHb">92</span><span class="undefined">]

</span><span class="yqj1Pc">fig</span><span class="undefined">, </span><span class="yqj1Pc">axes</span><span class="undefined"> = plt.subplots(</span><span class="N1kUHb">1</span><span class="undefined">, </span><span class="N1kUHb">2</span><span class="undefined">, figsize=(</span><span class="N1kUHb">12</span><span class="undefined">, </span><span class="N1kUHb">5</span><span class="undefined">))

</span><span class="ojrtQ"># Plot A: Age Profile</span><span class="undefined">
axes[</span><span class="N1kUHb">0</span><span class="undefined">].hist(ages, bins=</span><span class="N1kUHb">6</span><span class="undefined">, color=</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">dodgerblue</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">, edgecolor=</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">white</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">, alpha=</span><span class="N1kUHb">0.8</span><span class="undefined">)
axes[</span><span class="N1kUHb">0</span><span class="undefined">].set_title(</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">Student Age Profile Distribution</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">, fontsize=</span><span class="N1kUHb">12</span><span class="undefined">, fontweight=</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">bold</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">, pad=</span><span class="N1kUHb">10</span><span class="undefined">)
axes[</span><span class="N1kUHb">0</span><span class="undefined">].set_xlabel(</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">Age</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">)
axes[</span><span class="N1kUHb">0</span><span class="undefined">].set_ylabel(</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">Count</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">)
axes[</span><span class="N1kUHb">0</span><span class="undefined">].grid(axis=</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">y</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">, linestyle=</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">--</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">, alpha=</span><span class="N1kUHb">0.7</span><span class="undefined">)

</span><span class="ojrtQ"># Plot B: Scatter plot trend</span><span class="undefined">
axes[</span><span class="N1kUHb">1</span><span class="undefined">].scatter(hours, scores, color=</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">crimson</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">, s=</span><span class="N1kUHb">100</span><span class="undefined">, edgecolors=</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">black</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">, zorder=</span><span class="N1kUHb">3</span><span class="undefined">)
axes[</span><span class="N1kUHb">1</span><span class="undefined">].plot(np.unique(hours), np.poly1d(np.polyfit(hours, scores, </span><span class="N1kUHb">1</span><span class="undefined">))(np.unique(hours)), color=</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">darkgrey</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">, linestyle=</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">--</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">, linewidth=</span><span class="N1kUHb">2</span><span class="undefined">)
axes[</span><span class="N1kUHb">1</span><span class="undefined">].set_title(</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">Study Hours vs. Academic Metric Correlation</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">, fontsize=</span><span class="N1kUHb">12</span><span class="undefined">, fontweight=</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">bold</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">, pad=</span><span class="N1kUHb">10</span><span class="undefined">)
axes[</span><span class="N1kUHb">1</span><span class="undefined">].set_xlabel(</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">Hours Studied Per Week</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">)
axes[</span><span class="N1kUHb">1</span><span class="undefined">].set_ylabel(</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">Exam Scores</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">)
axes[</span><span class="N1kUHb">1</span><span class="undefined">].grid(</span><span class="uiJ0Tc">True</span><span class="undefined">, linestyle=</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">--</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">, alpha=</span><span class="N1kUHb">0.7</span><span class="undefined">)

plt.tight_layout()
plt.savefig(</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">data_insights_dashboard.png</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">, dpi=</span><span class="N1kUHb">150</span><span class="undefined">)
plt.close()
