epip="" jsuid="gGmP3d_29" data-complete="true">Click the small <strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="gGmP3d_2a" data-complete="true"><code dir="ltr" class="KDcb0c" jsaction="" jscontroller="hNviFe#redMub" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="gGmP3d_2b" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style="">+<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></code><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> icon at the very top of your Notepad window (right next to your <code dir="ltr" class="KDcb0c" jsaction="" jscontroller="hNviFe#redMub" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="gGmP3d_2c" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style="">cleaned_dataset.csv<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></code> tab) to open a fresh, blank tab.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="gGmP3d_2d" data-hveid="CAAIExAC" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style=""><span class="iNqyIf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="KdQfFc#d5Qebf" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="gGmP3d_2e" data-complete="true"><strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="gGmP3d_2f" data-complete="true">Copy and paste<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> this exact code block into that empty tab space:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><span jsuid="gGmP3d_2g" class="DHPVt Wg1cdb notranslate" data-suuid="nCd0md|0660c1f4-58a4-4cb6-82a0-cb43bbd496a1-|" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;gGmP3d_2g|npT2md" jscontroller="XqmSxe#JjQTXe" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" data-wiz-uids="gGmP3d_2i,gGmP3d_2h,gGmP3d_2j" data-complete="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><span class="NMq1me" data-animation-atomic="" jsaction="click:&amp;gGmP3d_2g|ZUljYd" data-sae="" style=""><span aria-hidden="true">&nbsp;</span><span class=""><span class=""><!--qkimaf gGmP3d_2g/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb gGmP3d_2g/HugV6--><button jsuid="gGmP3d_2h" tabindex="0" data-amic="true" data-icl-uuid="0660c1f4-58a4-4cb6-82a0-cb43bbd496a1" aria-label="Related results" class="vDOt8c" jsaction="click:&amp;gGmP3d_2g|CXhG2e;mouseenter:&amp;gGmP3d_2g|wndyDd;mouseleave:&amp;gGmP3d_2g|yrMC6" data-ved="2ahUKEwjWhtbs-sWXAxXbkeEIHYSVL8oQye0OegYIAAgTEAM" data-hveid="CAAIExAD"><span class="pxxQye T6UJT"><div class="a14YJe"><svg class="EQxvpc MZhYme" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" aria-hidden="true" jsaction="" jscontroller="vODoFe#cKfyCe" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="gGmP3d_2k" data-complete="true"><path d="M440-280H280q-83,0-141.5-58.5T80-480t58.5-141.5T280-680H440v80H280q-50,0-85,35t-35,85t35,85t85,35H440v80ZM320-440v-80H640v80H320ZM520-280v-80H680q50,0 85-35t35-85t-35-85t-85-35H520v-80H680q83,0 141.5,58.5T880-480T821.5-338.5T680-280H520Z"></path><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></svg></div></span><div jsuid="gGmP3d_2i" style="display: none;" data-ved="2ahUKEwjWhtbs-sWXAxXbkeEIHYSVL8oQlZkRegYIAAgTEAQ"></div></button></span></span></span><!--qkimaf gGmP3d_2g/WyzG9e--><!--cqw1tb gGmP3d_2g/WyzG9e--><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;0660c1f4-58a4-4cb6-82a0-cb43bbd496a1&quot;,null,null,0,&quot;&quot;,&quot;&quot;,0,null,null,null,null,0,null,0]]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></ol><div class="yhAwj" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;gGmP3d_2l|npT2md" jscontroller="UTzWVc#U8DOt" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" jsuid="gGmP3d_2l" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><div jsuid="gGmP3d_2m" class="BpxUDf aiModeUiCodeBlock__Container" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="Liu6s#lcO7sb" data-sfc-root="ep" data-epip="" data-wiz-uids="gGmP3d_2o,gGmP3d_2n" data-hveid="CAAIFBAA" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"><div data-processed="true"><div class="rq1a2" data-animation-atomic="" data-sae="" style=""><div class="a2TNg"><div class="GlO4G">python</div></div><div class="PGvq2d" dir="ltr"><pre><code jsuid="gGmP3d_2o"><span class="uiJ0Tc">import</span><span class="undefined"> </span><span class="yqj1Pc">pandas</span><span class="undefined"> </span><span class="uiJ0Tc">as</span><span class="undefined"> pd
</span><span class="uiJ0Tc">import</span><span class="undefined"> </span><span class="yqj1Pc">numpy</span><span class="undefined"> </span><span class="uiJ0Tc">as</span><span class="undefined"> np
</span><span class="uiJ0Tc">import</span><span class="undefined"> </span><span class="yqj1Pc">matplotlib</span><span class="undefined">.</span><span class="yqj1Pc">pyplot</span><span class="undefined"> </span><span class="uiJ0Tc">as</span><span class="undefined"> plt
</span><span class="uiJ0Tc">import</span><span class="undefined"> </span><span class="yqj1Pc">seaborn</span><span class="undefined"> </span><span class="uiJ0Tc">as</span><span class="undefined"> sns

</span><span class="ojrtQ"># 1. Load the raw dataset</span><span class="undefined">
</span><span class="yqj1Pc">df</span><span class="undefined"> = pd.read_csv(</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">raw_dataset.csv</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">)

</span><span class="ojrtQ"># 2. Clean data fields (Removes exact row duplicates)</span><span class="undefined">
</span><span class="yqj1Pc">df</span><span class="undefined"> = df.drop_duplicates()

</span><span class="ojrtQ"># 3. Clean metric columns (Filter out impossible outlier rows)</span><span class="undefined">
</span><span class="yqj1Pc">df</span><span class="undefined"> = df[(df[</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">Age</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">] &gt; </span><span class="N1kUHb">0</span><span class="undefined">) &amp; (df[</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">Age</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">] &lt; </span><span class="N1kUHb">100</span><span class="undefined">)]
</span><span class="yqj1Pc">df</span><span class="undefined"> = df[(df[</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">Exam_Score</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">] &gt;= </span><span class="N1kUHb">0</span><span class="undefined">) &amp; (df[</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">Exam_Score</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">] &lt;= </span><span class="N1kUHb">100</span><span class="undefined">)]

</span><span class="ojrtQ"># 4. Handle remaining missing value entries using column medians</span><span class="undefined">
df[</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">Age</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">] = df[</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">Age</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">].fillna(df[</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">Age</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">].median())
df[</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">Study_Hours</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">] = df[</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">Study_Hours</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">].fillna(df[</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">Study_Hours</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">].median())
df[</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">Exam_Score</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">] = df[</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">Exam_Score</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">].fillna(df[</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">Exam_Score</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">].median())

</span><span class="ojrtQ"># 5. Export clean database file</span><span class="undefined">
df.to_csv(</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="dk3nFb">cleaned_dataset.csv</span><span class="dk3nFb">'</span><span class="undefined">, index=</span><span class="uiJ0Tc">False</span><span class="undefined">)
